	<TextRow
		Label="msg_h04r0201_baker_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あら？
はじめてましてさん　ね▼
じゃ　なにもいわずに　しょうぶよ！
よういは　いいかしら？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-16T05:54:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-19T07:19:48" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あら？
はじめてましてさん　ね▼
じゃ　なにもいわずに　勝負よ！
用意は　いいかしら？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-16T05:53:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-19T07:19:52" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・初回
・はい/いいえの選択肢表示
　はい　→baker_02
　いいえ→baker_03
・まず戦闘
・クリア後に特性みつあつめのポケモンをみせる遊び
※swanで追加</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T09:30:05" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BAKER
パン屋</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-19T07:18:49" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T05:53:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_h04r0201_baker_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そうでなくちゃ！▼
あたしは　つよい　ポケモンに
おいしい　パンを　あげたいの！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-14T07:42:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T12:25:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そうでなくちゃ！▼
あたしは　強い　ポケモンに
美味しい　パンを　あげたいの！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-16T05:53:56" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T12:25:30" />
		</LanguageCell>
