	<TextRow
		Label="msg_h04r0201_baker_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まあ　なんて　トレーナー！▼
じぶんの　ポケモンを　りかいし
しんじているからの　けっか　ね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-16T05:55:58" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T09:38:38" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>まあ　なんて　トレーナー！▼
自分の　ポケモンを　理解し
信じているからの　結果ね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-16T05:55:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T09:53:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・トレーナー戦闘後、自動で表示
・クリアしている場合は続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T09:38:33" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BAKER
パン屋</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T09:36:47" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T05:53:22" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_h04r0201_baker_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そんな　すてきな
あなたに　おねがい！▼
あまいミツを　ふんだんに　つかった
パンを　つくろうと　してるんだ！▼
でね　とくせい「みつあつめ」の
ポケモンを　みせてくれない？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T09:47:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T09:46:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そんな　すてきな
あなたに　お願い！▼
あまいミツを　ふんだんに　使った
パンを　つくろうと　してるんだ！▼
でね　特性「みつあつめ」の
ポケモンを　みせてくれない？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-16T05:56:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T09:53:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・
・持っている場合は続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T09:47:57" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BAKER
パン屋</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T09:36:47" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T05:53:22" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
